.TH AM-LITE 1 "June 2026" "am-lite 2.0.0" "am-lite Manual"
.SH NAME
am-lite \- Minimalist Application Manager for AppImages and Portable Apps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B am-lite
[\fIglobal options\fR]
.I <command>
[\fIarguments\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B am-lite
is a production-grade, lightweight package manager for AppImages and portable Linux binaries.
It leverages the ivan-hc/AM repository database of over 2500 application installation scripts.
For high-performance downloading, it transparently wraps download calls from those scripts and routes them through
.BR aria2c (1).
.PP
If executed by a non-root user without global flags,
.B am-lite
automatically falls back to a sandboxed user-space mode.
It rewrites installer script paths dynamically, permitting system-wide applications to install, run, and remove safely inside the user's home directory ($HOME) without root access.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR \-i ", " install " " \fIapp\fR...
Install one or more applications. Downloads and executes the corresponding install script.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " remove " " \fIapp\fR...
Uninstall one or more applications. Executes the remover script associated with the applications.
.TP
.BR \-u ", " update " [" \fIapp\fR...]
Update the specified applications. If no applications are specified, updates all currently installed applications.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " search " " \fIquery\fR
Search the remote AM database for applications matching the query string.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " list
List all applications currently installed via am-lite.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " help
Show the help and usage summary.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Automatically answer "yes" to all installation confirmation prompts, executing non-interactively.
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-global ", " \-\-system
Force system-wide installation. This installs apps to /opt and symlinks to /usr/local/bin. Requires root privileges or sudo.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config " " \fIfile\fR
Specify an alternative configuration file to override the default system or user configurations.
.TP
.BR \-\-verbose
Enable verbose debug logs to console and logfile.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the software version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/am-lite.conf
Default system-wide configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.config/am-lite/config
Default user-space configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/am-lite/opt/
Default installation path for user-space (non-root) installations.
.TP
.I /opt/
Default installation path for system-wide (root) installations.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/am-lite/am-lite.log
Log file path for user-space actions.
.TP
.I /var/log/am-lite.log
Log file path for system-wide actions.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aria2c (1),
.BR curl (1),
.BR wget (1)
